    activates a card or effect: You can return 1 Level 7 or higher monster you control
    to the hand; Special Summon 1 monster that mentions "Light and Darkness Ritual"
    from your hand, with a different name than the returned monster, ignoring its
    Summoning conditions. You cannot activate these effects of "Mind Shuffle" in
    the same Chain.'
